*.apk
*.aab
*.ipa
*.xcworkspace
*.xcuserstate
*.xcuserdatad
*.xcsettings
*.xcscmblueprint
*.xcodeproj/*
*.plist

# 텍스처, 머티리얼, 프리팹, 메타 파일은 반드시 포함
!Assets/**/*.png
!Assets/**/*.jpg
!Assets/**/*.tga
!Assets/**/*.mat
!Assets/**/*.prefab
